ms\" class=\"flow-choice\" data-bl-b=\"\"><input id=\"_R_4klritpesnfknelb_-collection-professional-films\" type=\"radio\" name=\"collection\" value=\"professional-films\"><span class=\"flow-choice__text\"><span class=\"flow-choice__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Professional Films</span></span><span class=\"flow-choice__desc\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Edited films from Oakhouse Visuals.</span></span></span></label><label for=\"_R_4klritpesnfknelb_-collection-raw-archive\" class=\"flow-choice\" data-bl-b=\"\"><input id=\"_R_4klritpesnfknelb_-collection-raw-archive\" type=\"radio\" name=\"collection\" value=\"raw-archive\"><span class=\"flow-choice__text\"><span class=\"flow-choice__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Raw / Archive</span></span><span class=\"flow-choice__desc\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Raw footage and originals. Admin only.</span></span></span></label></div></fieldset></div></section></div><footer class=\"flow-foot\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"footer\"><span></span><div class=\"flow-foot__nav\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"ops-button ops-button-primary\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Continue</span></button></div></footer></form></dialog></div></div></div><section id=\"import\" class=\"ops-section\" data-bl-k=\"section\"><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Have the contract to hand: “Import a delivery” asks who delivered the files, who holds the copyright, how they reached you and what the licence allows, then for the files themselves.</span></p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div>"
